Hello 3DPrint.com team,

a story lead built around a single, visual idea.

A downloaded STL of a knurled handle contains no knurl. It contains a few
hundred triangles that happen to look like one. That is why no tool lets you
make the grooves deeper: there is nothing to change, only geometry to redraw.

Solidon3D 0.5.0 recognises the pattern itself — a honeycomb, knurl, set of
ribs, waves or knobs — and presents it as one feature with pitch, cell width
and depth. One click removes it; three numbers set it again, with the cells
staying where they were. Around a cylinder the pattern is measured in the
unrolled surface, so the grooves are equally deep everywhere and the pattern
closes around the circumference without a seam; the pitch moves to the value
that divides evenly, and the software says which one.

The structural change behind it: the mesh becomes an exact body. Primitives
are built with real faces and edges, and holes, slots, countersinks, bosses,
beads, grooves and threads stay exact through moving, duplicating, rotating
and removing. STEP goes in and comes back out cleanly, so the result can be
carried into a CAD system instead of arriving as triangles again. The options
that used to switch between the mesh and the exact kernel are gone.

Other items from this release: dimensions are edited directly on the model
with a live preview; an existing thread gets its counterpart on the other part
at the press of a button, in a table size and as a fit; resin printers are
supported; a model with open areas is closed while it is read; and moving a
200,000-triangle model answers in half a second instead of eight.

70 user-visible changes in this release, 896 since the first 0.1 demo.

Solidon3D is a desktop application for Windows, macOS and Linux. One-time
purchase, no subscription, no account: after a single activation it runs fully
offline. Interface and manual are available in six languages, and there is a
demo.

I am happy to provide a review licence, print-resolution images or answers to
any question directly.

